<title>AUSTRIA: Austria's EVN details H1 profit data.</title>
<headline>Austria's EVN details H1 profit data.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months to end February. (Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1996/97	   1995/96</p>
<p> Pretax profit			1,621	     1,886</p>
<p> Operating profit		   1,430	     1,731</p>
<p> Cash flow			    1,991	     2,090</p>
<p> Investment in fixed assets     1,019		 927</p>
<p> Sales				  7,029	     6,946</p>
<p> Electricity sales (GWh)	  3,131	     3,083</p>
<p> Electricity revenues	     4,247	     4,197</p>
<p> Gas sales (million cum)	    911		 902</p>
<p> Gas revenues			 2,430	     2,439</p>
<p> Heating sales (GWh)		  297		 257</p>
<p> Heating revenues		     159		 123</p>
<p> Workforce			    2,592	     2,716</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Energieversorgung Niederoesterreich AG.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
